    "title": "Over 24 hours, Trump's authoritarian vision comes into focus (yes, again) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Steve Benen ,\n15 hours ago When Republicans complain about Donald Trump’s critics on the left using intemperate rhetoric, they often point to the frequency with which the president’s detractors accuse him of being an “authoritarian.” The complaints, however, tend to miss the point: The problem is with Trump’s actions, not with his opponents noticing those actions. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
